    {
      "id": "zr6zj6s",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "13. MCLR (MARGINAL COST OF FUNDS BASED LENDING RATE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Credit Multiplier formula: 1 / CRR.",
        "Minimum CAR requirement in India under RBI/Basel III norms is 9%.",
        "MCLR replaced the Base Rate system in 2016.",
        "14 banks were nationalised in 1969 and 6 more banks in 1980."
      ],
      "id": "v9pfakv"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "MCLR is the minimum interest rate below which banks cannot lend (except special cases).",
      "id": "qyrgx11"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Introduced in 2016 to improve monetary policy transmission.",
      "id": "xbsewgg"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "It replaced the Base Rate system.",
      "id": "uhbf77y"
    },
    {
      "id": "9j0256b",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "14. MAJOR BANKING REFORMS"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "• Bank Nationalisation (1969 &amp; 1980)<br/>• Narasimham Committee Reforms (1991 &amp; 1998)<br/>• Basel III Implementation<br/>• Insolvency and Bankruptcy Code (2016)<br/>• Bank mergers and recapitalisation<br/>",
      "id": "9lrv02l"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Objective: Strengthen banks and reduce NPAs.",
      "id": "583ndoq"
    },
    {
      "id": "diyxtid",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "15. RRB IMPORTANT ONE-LINERS"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "• Banking Regulation Act – 1949<br/>• 14 banks nationalised in 1969<br/>• NPA overdue period – 90 days<br/>• Credit Multiplier = 1/CRR<br/>• RBI regulates banking system<br/>",
      "id": "m0ybnht"
    }
  ],
